---
pagination:
  data: regions
  size: 1
  alias: region
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "/{{ region.slug }}/"
modified: "2026-11-17"
bodyClass: "page-template page-loaded svc-topic v2"
activeKey: "areas"
headExtra: |
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/chayce-nav.css?v={{ build.version }}">
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Elderly Removals: {{ region.short }} | Chayce"
  description: "Elderly removals, downsizing help and later-life moving in {{ region.name | replace('The ', 'the ') }}, arranged from Northampton with one coordinator. From £995."
---
<header class="v2-hero" style="background-image:url({% imageUrl region.img %});{% imageSet region.img %}">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <h1><span class="h1-kicker">Elderly Removals<span class="v2-kick-more"> &middot; {{ region.short }}</span></span>Elderly Removals &amp; Downsizing Help in <em>{{ region.name }}</em></h1>
    <p class="v2-lead">Later-life moves in {{ region.name | replace('The ', 'the ') }}, planned from our Northampton office with one coordinator and realistic travel times.</p>
    <div class="v2-actions"><a class="v2-btn primary" href="/get-started/">Get Started</a><a class="v2-tel" href="tel:{{ site.telephone }}"><i class="fas fa-phone" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{ site.telephoneDisplay }}</a></div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="v2-trust"><div class="v2-wrap">
  <span class="v2-pill"><i class="fas fa-user-shield" aria-hidden="true"></i>DBS-Checked Team</span>
  <span class="v2-pill"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt" aria-hidden="true"></i>Fully Insured</span>
  <span class="v2-pill"><i class="fas fa-user-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>One Coordinator</span>
  <span class="v2-pill"><i class="fas fa-landmark" aria-hidden="true"></i>Since 2021</span>
</div></div>

<section class="v2-sec grey">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <div class="v2-intro">
      <div><span class="v2-eyebrow">{{ region.short }}</span><h2 class="v2-h2">Elderly removals in <em>{{ region.short }}</em></h2></div>
      <div class="sa-answer">
        <p><strong>Chayce Properties arranges elderly removals, downsizing help, careful packing and settling-in support in {{ region.name | replace('The ', 'the ') }}, with one dedicated coordinator and DBS-checked staff.</strong> We are based in Northampton, and packages start from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }}.</p>
        <p>{{ region.intro }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="v2-sec">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <div class="v2-head"><span class="v2-eyebrow">What tends to matter</span><h2 class="v2-h2">{{ region.h2 | safe }}</h2></div>
    <div class="v2-incl">
      <div><div class="v2-points">
        {% for c in region.cards %}<div class="v2-point"><i class="fas {{ c.icon }}" aria-hidden="true"></i><div><h3>{{ c.title }}</h3><p>{{ c.text }}</p></div></div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div></div>
      <aside class="v2-price" aria-label="Prices">
        {% for r in [["bronze","from","Packing, insured removal, furniture reassembly and light cleaning."],["silver","from","Adds declutter help, a deep clean and unpacking, with a coordinator."],["discovery","one-off","Not sure yet? A one-hour plan, timeline and budget."]] %}{% set pk = site.packages | findByKey(r[0]) %}<div class="pr"><span class="amt"><small>{{ r[1] }}</small>&pound;{{ pk.price | gbp }}</span><span class="nm">{{ pk.name }}</span><p>{{ r[2] }}</p></div>
        {% endfor %}
        <a class="v2-btn primary" href="/packages/">Compare packages</a>
        <p class="fine">Final price confirmed in writing before you book.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="v2-sec grey">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <div class="v2-head c"><span class="v2-eyebrow">How it works</span><h2 class="v2-h2">From first call to <em>settled in</em></h2><p class="v2-lede">{{ region.note }}</p></div>
    <ol class="v2-steps">
      <li><span class="n">01</span><h3>Plan it</h3><p>A Discovery Consultation, by phone or in person, gives you a plan, timeline and budget.</p></li>
      <li><span class="n">02</span><h3>Sort and decide</h3><p>We agree with you what comes, what stays and what goes, room by room and at your pace.</p></li>
      <li><span class="n">03</span><h3>Pack and move</h3><p>Careful packing, then a fully insured removal on the day that suits you.</p></li>
      <li><span class="n">04</span><h3>Settle in</h3><p>Unpacking and set-up at the new home, depending on your package, so it feels familiar.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="v2-sec">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <div class="v2-head c"><span class="v2-eyebrow">Questions</span><h2 class="v2-h2">{{ region.short }}: <em>your questions answered</em></h2></div>
    <div class="v2-faq">
      {% for f in region.faqs %}<details><summary>{{ f.q }}</summary><p>{{ f.a }}</p></details>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="v2-sec" style="border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <div class="v2-head c"><span class="v2-eyebrow">Keep exploring</span><h2 class="v2-h2">Related help and <em>other regions</em></h2></div>
    <div class="v2-related">
      <div>
        <h3>Help with your move</h3>
        <ul class="v2-list">
          <li><a href="/downsizing-help-for-elderly/">Downsizing help<i>&rarr;</i></a></li>
          <li><a href="/moving-elderly-parent/">Moving an elderly parent<i>&rarr;</i></a></li>
          <li><a href="/retirement-village-removals/">Retirement village moves<i>&rarr;</i></a></li>
          <li><a href="/care-home-removals/">Care home removals<i>&rarr;</i></a></li>
          <li><a href="/storage-during-your-move/">Storage between moves<i>&rarr;</i></a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Other regions</h3>
        <ul class="v2-list">
          <li><a href="/elderly-removals-northampton/">Northampton<small>our office</small><i>&rarr;</i></a></li>
          {% for r in regions %}{% if r.slug != region.slug %}<li><a href="/{{ r.slug }}/">{{ r.short }}<i>&rarr;</i></a></li>{% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
          <li><a href="/areas-we-cover/">All areas we cover<i>&rarr;</i></a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="v2-final">
  <div class="v2-wrap">
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="txt">
        <h2 class="v2-h2">Planning a move in <em>{{ region.short }}?</em></h2>
        <p>Tell us what is happening and we&rsquo;ll explain the options plainly, with no obligation.</p>
        <div class="btn-row"><a href="/get-started/" class="v2-btn primary">Get Started</a><a href="/contact/?callback=1" class="v2-btn ghost">Request a Callback</a></div>
        <span class="tel">Or call <a href="tel:{{ site.telephone }}">{{ site.telephoneDisplay }}</a>, Monday to Friday, {{ site.openingHours.opens }} to {{ site.openingHours.closes }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="img" style="background-image:url({% imageUrl 'chayce-hero2.jpg', 900 %})"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"{{ site.url }}/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Areas We Cover","item":"{{ site.url }}/areas-we-cover/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"{{ region.short }}","item":"{{ site.url }}/{{ region.slug }}/"}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{% for f in region.faqs %}{"@type":"Question","name":{{ f.q | dump | safe }},"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":{{ f.a | dump | safe }}}}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","url":"{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}","inLanguage":"en-GB","dateModified":"{{ modified }}","author":{"@id":"{{ site.url }}/#organization"},"speakable":{"@type":"SpeakableSpecification","cssSelector":["h1",".sa-answer p"]}}</script>
